            "notes": "[Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) is here to farm cash. \n\nIf your other support is the primary healer, 90% of the time you're throwing damage orbs and letting the healing orb be the second with less capacity.\n\n[Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) is a great pickup if there's a kiri on the enemy team, it triggers if you get an elim on a clone.\n\nPlay safe, use fade to escape. Staying alive is the most important way to farm cash, especially in early rounds.",
