            "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:28:06.069742+00:00",
            "notes": "With [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) you have a 15% boost in [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and a ton of surviability thanks to the armor and [Move Speed](stat_move_speed). \n\nThe [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) boost makes your grasp far more deadly. You can get a little more aggressive on this round and look for more elims, but your #1 priority is still staying alive. Look to chase down squishy targets and avoid the tank.\n\nKeep throwing mostly damage orbs.",
