            "notes": "This is the round where [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) becomes a monster. With [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), you can proc [Deconstruction](item_cc8c46cc-b4a3-4c0f-aeb6-f7837e0e8e7c) quickly and combined with [Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) your ability to shred any hero goes off the charts. \n\n[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) can be triggered with both [Biotic Orb](ability_721997d0-c151-4a4c-bb11-86552b14def6) and [Fade](ability_438ee61f-f7ed-4321-9ca3-d3577b89ba19) for a devastating 18% of any hero's life from that item alone. You should feel confident that you have the damage and survivability to win 1v1s. \n\nIf you see an isolated squishy, throw an orb, get the TTT damage then fade in for more TTT damage and confirm the kill.\n\nAt this point, if you weren't already, you should be out damaging your DPS teammates.",
